---
layout: layouts/standalone.njk
title: Билгийн тоолол · Lunar calendar
description: Subscribable Mongol, Tibetan and Bhutanese lunar calendars for Apple, Google and Outlook calendar apps.
language: mn
permalink: /cal/beta/
noindex: true
langnames:
  mn: { mn: Монгол, en: Mongolian }
  en: { mn: Англи, en: English }
  bo: { mn: བོད་ཡིག, en: བོད་ཡིག }
  dz: { mn: རྫོང་ཁ, en: རྫོང་ཁ }
days:
  d115: { mn: Шинийн 1 ба 15, en: 1st & 15th }
  d1: { mn: Шинийн 1, en: 1st only }
  ausp: { mn: Балжка Дашка, en: Auspicious days }
  d115_tib: { mn: ཚེས་༡ དང་༡༥, en: ཚེས་༡ དང་༡༥ }
  d1_tib: { mn: ཚེས་༡ ཁོ་ན།, en: ཚེས་༡ ཁོ་ན། }
mongol:
  name: { mn: Монгол билгийн тоолол, en: Mongol lunar calendar }
  # [language, label set, 1st+15th file, 1st-only file, auspicious-days file]
  rows:
    - [mn, "", mongol-mn.ics, mongol-mn-no15.ics, mongol-auspicious-mn.ics]
    - [en, "", mongol-en.ics, mongol-en-no15.ics, mongol-auspicious-en.ics]
  festivals:
    mn: "Баяр ёслол: Битүүн, Цагаан сар, Их дүйчин, Чингис хааны төрсөн өдөр. Есөн ес: ес бүрийн эхний өдөр, уламжлалт хэлцийн хамт. Балжка Дашка: уламжлалт зурхайн бичигт заасан Балжинням, Дашням, Модон хохимой, Тэрсүүд."
    en: "Festivals: Bituun, Tsagaan Sar, Ikh Düichen, Chinggis Khaan's birthday. Nine Nines: the first day of each nine, with its folk saying. Auspicious days: Baljinnyam, Dashnyam, Modon khokhimoi and Tersüüd, as given in the traditional Mongolian almanac."
others:
  - name: { mn: Төвд зурхай (Пүг), en: Tibetan calendar (Phugpa) }
    native: བོད་ཀྱི་ལོ་ཐོ། (ཕུག་ལུགས།)
    rows:
      - [bo, _tib, phugpa-bo.ics, phugpa-bo-no15.ics]
      - [en, "", phugpa-en.ics, phugpa-en-no15.ics]
  - name: { mn: Төвд зурхай (Цүр), en: Tibetan calendar (Tsurphu) }
    native: བོད་ཀྱི་ལོ་ཐོ། (མཚུར་ལུགས།)
    rows:
      - [bo, _tib, tsurphu-bo.ics, tsurphu-bo-no15.ics]
      - [en, "", tsurphu-en.ics, tsurphu-en-no15.ics]
  - name: { mn: Бутан зурхай, en: Bhutanese calendar }
    native: འབྲུག་གི་ལོ་ཐོ།
    rows:
      - [dz, _tib, bhutan-dz.ics, bhutan-dz-no15.ics]
      - [en, "", bhutan-en.ics, bhutan-en-no15.ics]
tibfest:
  mn: "Баяр ёслол: Лосар ба дөрвөн их дүйчин."
  en: "Festivals: Losar and the four düchen."
---
{% macro t(o) %}<span class="l-mn">{{ o.mn }}</span><span class="l-en">{{ o.en }}</span>{% endmacro %}
{% macro pill(file, label) %}<a class="cal-pill" data-feed="{{ file }}" href="/cal/{{ file }}"><span class="pill-label"><span class="l-mn">{{ label.mn }}</span><span class="l-en">{{ label.en }}</span></span><span class="pill-msg"><span class="l-mn">✓ Хуулагдлаа</span><span class="l-en">✓ Copied</span></span></a>{% endmacro %}
<script>
  (function () {
    var root = document.documentElement, lang = "mn", app = "";
    try {
      var q = new URLSearchParams(location.search);
      lang = q.get("lang") || localStorage.getItem("cal-lang") || "mn";
      app = q.get("app") || localStorage.getItem("cal-app") || "";
    } catch (e) {}
    if (lang === "en") { root.classList.add("ui-en"); root.lang = "en"; }
    var ua = navigator.userAgent;
    var ios = /iPhone|iPad|iPod/.test(ua) || (/Macintosh/.test(ua) && navigator.maxTouchPoints > 1);
    var android = /Android/.test(ua);
    if (["apple", "google", "other"].indexOf(app) < 0) {
      app = (ios || /Macintosh/.test(ua)) ? "apple" : "google";
    }
    root.dataset.app = app;
    root.dataset.phone = (ios || android) ? "1" : "0";
    root.dataset.android = android ? "1" : "0";
    root.dataset.inapp = (/FBAN|FBAV|FB_IAB|Instagram|Line\/|MicroMessenger/.test(ua) ||
                          (android && /; wv\)/.test(ua))) ? "1" : "0";
  })();
</script>
<style>
  html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-size-adjust: 100%; }
  html:not(.ui-en) .l-en, html.ui-en .l-mn { display: none !important; }
  .cal-head h1 { max-width: none; }
  .cal-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem; }
  .lang-switch { font-size: 0.95rem; white-space: nowrap; padding-top: 0.6rem; }
  .lang-switch a { text-decoration: none; }
  html:not(.ui-en) .lang-switch [data-set="mn"],
  html.ui-en .lang-switch [data-set="en"] { font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; }

  /* In-app browser banner (Facebook, Instagram, …) */
  .inapp { display: none; position: relative; margin: 0 0 1.2rem; padding: 0.7rem 2.2rem 0.7rem 0.9rem;
           border: 1px solid var(--accent-2, #b06a00); border-radius: 0.6rem; background: #fff8ec; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  html[data-inapp="1"] .inapp { display: block; }
  .inapp button { position: absolute; top: 0.3rem; right: 0.5rem; border: 0; background: none; font-size: 1.2rem; cursor: pointer; color: inherit; }

  /* Calendar-app switch and its instructions */
  .app-box { margin: 1.2rem 0 1.6rem; padding: 0.9rem 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 0.8rem; background: var(--panel-2); }
  .app-switch { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
  .app-switch .lbl { margin-right: 0.2rem; }
  .app-switch .seg button { font: inherit; font-size: 0.95rem; padding: 0.2rem 0.9rem; cursor: pointer;
                            background: #fff; color: var(--link); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
  html[data-app="apple"] .app-switch [data-app="apple"],
  html[data-app="google"] .app-switch [data-app="google"],
  html[data-app="other"] .app-switch [data-app="other"] { background: var(--link); color: #fff; border-color: var(--link); }
  .how { display: none; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .how p { margin: 0.2rem 0; }
  .how ol { margin: 0.2rem 0 0.2rem 1.3rem; padding: 0; }
  .how li { margin: 0.15rem 0; }
  html[data-app="apple"] .how-apple,
  html[data-app="google"][data-phone="0"] .how-google-pc,
  html[data-app="google"][data-phone="1"][data-android="0"] .how-google-phone,
  html[data-app="google"][data-android="1"] .how-google-android,
  html[data-android="1"] .how-other .android-only { display: block; }
  .how-other .android-only { display: none; }
  html[data-android="1"] .not-android { display: none; }
  .how .btn-line { margin: 0.35rem 0 0.5rem; }
  .how .goto { color: var(--link); text-decoration: underline; cursor: pointer; }
  html[data-app="other"] .how-other { display: block; }

  /* Segmented pills: either-or choices are joined */
  .seg { display: inline-flex; }
  .seg > * { border-radius: 0 !important; margin: 0 !important; }
  .seg > *:first-child { border-radius: 999px 0 0 999px !important; }
  .seg > *:last-child { border-radius: 0 999px 999px 0 !important; }
  .seg > * + * { border-left-width: 0 !important; }

  .cal-rows { margin: 0.6rem 0 0.4rem; }
  .cal-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 0.45rem 0.7rem;
             padding: 0.6rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .cal-row:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .cal-lang { min-width: 5.2rem; }
  .cal-pill { display: inline-block; padding: 0.15rem 0.8rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px;
              background: var(--panel-2); color: var(--link); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5;
              text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; }
  .cal-pill:hover, .cal-pill:focus-visible { border-color: var(--link); background: #fff; }
  .cal-pill .pill-msg { display: none; }
  .cal-pill.copied { color: var(--accent-2, #b06a00); }
  .cal-pill.copied .pill-label { display: none; }
  .cal-pill.copied .pill-msg { display: inline; }
  .feed-url { display: block; width: 100%; margin-top: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.8rem; }
  .cal-note { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--muted, #555); }
  .cal-native { font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 0.5rem; color: var(--muted, #555); }
  details.cal-more > summary { cursor: pointer; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: bold; padding: 0.3rem 0; }
  details.cal-more h3 { margin-top: 1.4rem; }
  .cal-footer { text-align: center; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted, #555); margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 1.2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line, #ddd); }
  .cal-footer a { font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .cal-lang { min-width: 100%; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--muted, #555); }
    .cal-head h1 { font-size: 2.6rem; }
    .cal-pill { padding: 0.15rem 0.6rem; font-size: 0.92rem; }
    .app-box { padding: 0.8rem; }
  }
</style>

<div class="cal-head">
  <h1><span class="l-mn">Билгийн тоолол</span><span class="l-en">Lunar calendar</span></h1>
  <nav class="lang-switch" aria-label="Language">
    <a href="?lang=mn" data-set="mn">MN</a> | <a href="?lang=en" data-set="en">EN</a>
  </nav>
</div>

<div class="inapp" role="note">
  <span class="l-mn">Энэ хуудас Facebook (эсвэл өөр апп)-ын дотор нээгдсэн байна. Календарь нэмэхэд асуудал гарвал цэснээс (⋮ эсвэл …) «Open in browser» / «Хөтчөөр нээх»-ийг сонгоорой.</span>
  <span class="l-en">This page is open inside Facebook (or another app). If adding a calendar doesn't work, choose "Open in browser" from the menu (⋮ or …).</span>
  <button type="button" aria-label="Close" onclick="this.parentNode.style.display='none'">×</button>
</div>

<p class="lede narrow l-mn">Сар бүрийн шинийн 1 ба 15, мөн билгийн тооллыг дагадаг гол баяр ёслолуудыг календарьтаа нэмээрэй. Огноог 2050 он хүртэл тооцоолсон.</p>
<p class="lede narrow l-en">Add lunar days 1 and 15 of every month, and the main festivals that follow the lunar calendar, to your calendar. The dates are computed up to 2050.</p>

<div class="app-box">
  <div class="app-switch">
    <span class="lbl"><span class="l-mn">Таны хуанли:</span><span class="l-en">Your calendar app:</span></span>
    <span class="seg">
      <button type="button" data-app="apple">Apple</button><button type="button" data-app="google">Google</button><button type="button" data-app="other"><span class="l-mn">Бусад</span><span class="l-en">Other</span></button>
    </span>
  </div>
  <div class="how how-apple">
    <p class="l-mn">Доорх календарь дээр дарж, захиалахыг зөвшөөрнө. iPhone, iPad, Mac-ийн «Calendar» апп-д нэмэгдэнэ.</p>
    <p class="l-en">Tap a calendar below and confirm the subscription. It is added to the Calendar app on iPhone, iPad or Mac.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="how how-google-pc">
    <p class="l-mn">Доорх календарь дээр дарахад Google хуанли нээгдэнэ; «Add calendar»-ыг дарна. Утсан дээрх Google Calendar апп-д мөн гарч ирнэ (харагдахгүй бол апп-ын тохиргооноос тухайн календарийн «Sync»-ийг асаана).</p>
    <p class="l-en">Click a calendar below; Google Calendar opens, then click "Add calendar". It also appears in the Google Calendar app on your phone (if hidden, turn on "Sync" for it in the app's settings).</p>
  </div>
  <div class="how how-google-phone">
    <ol class="l-mn">
      <li>Доорх календарь дээр дарахад холбоос нь хуулагдана.</li>
      <li>Chrome-оор (iPhone дээр Safari-аар) calendar.google.com хаягийг нээнэ.</li>
      <li>Цэснээс «Desktop site»-ыг асаана (Safari: aA → «Request Desktop Website»).</li>
      <li>⚙ Тохиргоо → «Add calendar» → «From URL» хэсэгт хуулсан холбоосоо paste хийж, «Add calendar» дарна.</li>
      <li>Google Calendar апп-д харагдахгүй бол апп-ын тохиргооноос тухайн календарийн «Sync»-ийг асаана.</li>
    </ol>
    <ol class="l-en">
      <li>Tap a calendar below; its link is copied.</li>
      <li>Open calendar.google.com in Chrome (Safari on iPhone).</li>
      <li>Turn on "Desktop site" in the menu (Safari: aA → "Request Desktop Website").</li>
      <li>⚙ Settings → "Add calendar" → "From URL": paste the link and press "Add calendar".</li>
      <li>If it doesn't show in the Google Calendar app, turn on "Sync" for it in the app's settings.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="cal-note l-mn">Компьютер байвал илүү хялбар: энэ хуудсыг компьютерээсээ нээж, календарь дээр дарна.</p>
    <p class="cal-note l-en">With a computer it is simpler: open this page there and click a calendar.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="how how-google-android">
    <p class="l-mn">Доорх календарь дээр дарахад Google Calendar апп нээгдэнэ; бүртгэлээ сонгоно. Календарь хэдэн минутын дотор ☰ цэсний «Other calendars» хэсэгт гарч ирнэ.</p>
    <p class="l-en">Tap a calendar below; the Google Calendar app opens and asks for your account. Within a few minutes the calendar appears under "Other calendars" in the ☰ menu.</p>
    <p class="cal-note l-mn">Нэмэгдэхгүй бол дээрх <a class="goto" href="?app=other" data-goto="other">Бусад</a>-ыг сонгоно.</p>
    <p class="cal-note l-en">If it isn't added, choose <a class="goto" href="?app=other" data-goto="other">Other</a> above.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="how how-other">
    <div class="android-only">
      <p class="l-mn">Android дээр Google хуанлид: доорх календарь дээр дарж холбоосыг нь хуулаад, энэ товчоор Google-ийн «From URL» хуудсыг нээнэ. «URL of calendar» нүдэнд paste хийж, «Add calendar» дарна.</p>
      <p class="l-en">Google Calendar on Android: tap a calendar below to copy its link, open Google's "From URL" page with this button, paste the link into "URL of calendar" and press "Add calendar".</p>
      <p class="btn-line"><a class="cal-pill" id="addbyurl" href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/r/settings/addbyurl">Google: From URL</a></p>
      <p class="l-mn">Google-гүй утсанд утасныхаа хуанлийн апп эсвэл ICSx⁵ апп-ыг ашиглана.</p>
      <p class="l-en">On phones without Google, use the phone's own calendar app or the ICSx⁵ app.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="l-mn">Доорх календарь дээр дарахад холбоос нь хуулагдана. Outlook, Thunderbird болон бусад програмын «Subscribe from web» эсвэл «Add calendar from URL» хэсэгт paste хийнэ. Outlook-ыг утсан дээрх хөтчөөр ашиглавал эхлээд «Desktop site» горимыг асаана. <span class="not-android">Google-ийн бус Android хуанлид ICSx⁵ апп-аар нэмж болно.</span></p>
    <p class="l-en">Tap a calendar below to copy its link, then paste it into "Subscribe from web" or "Add calendar from URL" in Outlook, Thunderbird or another app. Using Outlook in a phone browser, first turn on "Desktop site". <span class="not-android">For Android calendars other than Google, the ICSx⁵ app can add it.</span></p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="stack">
  <section class="rule-section">
    <h2>{{ t(mongol.name) }}</h2>
    <p class="cal-note l-mn">Шинийн 1 ба 15, эсвэл зөвхөн шинийн 1-ийг сонгоно. Балжка Дашкаг хамт нэмж болно.</p>
    <p class="cal-note l-en">Choose either "1st &amp; 15th" or "1st only". Auspicious days can be added as well.</p>
    <div class="cal-rows">
      {% for r in mongol.rows %}
        <div class="cal-row">
          <span class="cal-lang">{{ t(langnames[r[0]]) }}</span>
          <span class="seg">{{ pill(r[2], days.d115) }}{{ pill(r[3], days.d1) }}</span>
          {{ pill(r[4], days.ausp) }}
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="cal-note">{{ t(mongol.festivals) }}</p>
  </section>

  <details class="cal-more">
    <summary><span class="l-mn">Төвд, Бутан зурхай</span><span class="l-en">Tibetan and Bhutanese calendars</span></summary>
    <p class="cal-note l-mn">ཚེས་༡ དང་༡༥ (шинийн 1 ба 15), эсвэл ཚེས་༡ ཁོ་ན། (зөвхөн шинийн 1)-ийг сонгоно.</p>
    <p class="cal-note l-en">Choose either ཚེས་༡ དང་༡༥ (1st &amp; 15th) or ཚེས་༡ ཁོ་ན། (1st only).</p>
    {% for cal in others %}
      <h3>{{ t(cal.name) }} <span class="cal-native">{{ cal.native }}</span></h3>
      <div class="cal-rows">
        {% for r in cal.rows %}
          <div class="cal-row">
            <span class="cal-lang">{{ t(langnames[r[0]]) }}</span>
            <span class="seg">{{ pill(r[2], days["d115" + r[1]]) }}{{ pill(r[3], days["d1" + r[1]]) }}</span>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
    <p class="cal-note">{{ t(tibfest) }}</p>
  </details>

  <section class="rule-section l-mn">
    <h2>Дүрэм</h2>
    <p class="cal-note">Тоолол маань 2050 он хүртэл тооцоологдсон учраас нэг нэмчихсэн бол сүлжээгүй газар ч санаа амар байж болно. Ямар нэг шинэчлэл хийгдлээ гэхэд захиалсан хуанли түүнийг нь автоматаар тусгана.</p>
    <ul class="compact-list">
      <li>Шинийн 1 тасарвал сарын эхийг шинийн 2-нд тэмдэглэнэ. Шинийн 1 давтагдвал хоёр өдөр хоёул тэмдэглэгдэнэ.</li>
      <li>Шинийн 15 тасарвал шинийн 14-нийг, давтагдвал хоёр өдрийг хоёуланг харуулна. Тогтмол шинийн өдөрт тохиодог баярууд мөн энэ дүрмийг баримтална. Баярууд илүү сард биш, жирийн сард тохионо.</li>
      <li>Балжка Дашка өдрүүдийг Монгол зурхайн түгээмэл заншлаар тэмдэглэнэ: тасарсан шинийн өдөрт тохиовол өмнөх өдөрт нь; давхар өдрийн зөвхөн хоёр дахид нь. Илүү сард тэмдэглэхгүй (Л. Тэрбишийн зурхайн дагуу). Балжка Дашка нь үндсэн хуанлийн нэмэлт тул хамт нэмэхэд юу ч давхардахгүй.</li>
      <li>Бүх тэмдэглэл бүтэн өдрийнх бөгөөд "чөлөөтэй" гэж тэмдэглэгдсэн тул таны цагийн хуваарийг хаахгүй.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
  <section class="rule-section l-en">
    <h2>Conventions</h2>
    <p class="cal-note">The calendar is computed up to 2050, so once added it keeps working without a connection. If anything is updated, a subscribed calendar picks it up automatically.</p>
    <ul class="compact-list">
      <li>If lunar day 1 is omitted, the start of the month is marked on lunar day 2. If lunar day 1 is repeated, both days are marked.</li>
      <li>If lunar day 15 is omitted, lunar day 14 is shown; if it is repeated, both days are shown. Festivals on a fixed lunar day follow the same rule. Festivals fall in the regular, not the leap, month.</li>
      <li>Auspicious days follow the usual Mongolian almanac handling: a day falling on an omitted lunar day is shown on the day before; of a repeated lunar day only the second is marked. Leap months have none, following L. Terbish's almanac. They are an add-on to the main calendar: add both and nothing appears twice.</li>
      <li>Events are all-day and marked as free time, so they do not block your schedule.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</div>

